Manage configuration settings

Usage:
  eshu config [command]

Available Commands:
  db          Switch the default database backend
  reset       Reset all configuration to defaults
  set         Set one configuration value
  show        Display current configuration settings
  validate    Validate ESHU_* environment variables against the central registry

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for config

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu config [command] --help" for more information about a command.
